# <PROJECT> — Local Session State (gitignored)

Rename to `CLAUDE.local.md` (gitignored) and use for personal, per-machine, and
volatile state that doesn't belong in the committed AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md.
Keep it readable in one screenful plus a recent session log.

## Deployment

- Target: <host> (e.g. Synology NAS via `ssh <alias>`) at `<remote path>`
- Container: `<name>`, host port `<port>` (health at `http://<host>:<port>/health`)
- URL: `https://<name>.home` (Caddy vhost) — if applicable
- Deploy: `./scripts/deploy.sh` (configured via `.deploy.env`)

## Secrets (locations only — never values)

Stored in `.env.local` (dev) and `.env.production` (on the host, chmod 600):

- `AUTH_SECRET` — <what it protects>
- `<VAR>` — <what it's for>

Secret *values* live in 1Password / `~/.claude/secrets/` — never in this file.

## Session Log

Record ongoing work here between sessions. Promote durable lessons to
AGENTS.md § Critical gotchas and delete the entry. Trim to the last ~10 entries.

- <date>: <what changed>
